{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>西營盤恆輝大廈起火。(網上圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>西營盤發生火警。今日(19日)晚上8時許，薄扶林道22至32號恆輝大廈中層一個單位起火。消防接報到場，動用一條喉及一隊煙帽隊將火救熄。火警中，初步一名70多歲老翁昏迷，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救，惟其後證實不治。大批居民疏散至樓下暫避。警方及消防現正調查起火原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:14.027907+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:17:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:24:06.418525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:13.939155+00:00","content_hash":"7b00443d5b1cdf33ff64ec5e4e0f74b3b924bf42cbb330fc6f9d90f5c5c8c47a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}